Dialogue: 10,0:00:07.41,0:00:11.33,Narrator,,0,0,0,,"Yaemon the Locomotive"{the book} \Nhas been made into a fun anime film!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.41,0:00:16.71,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It's a story of a beautiful friendship and adventure
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.71,0:00:22.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,between the slightly worn out{/tired} but kind-hearted Yaemon \Nand the cheerful boy Tadashi.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.47,0:00:41.23,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Various animals will also appear\Nand tell their own fun stories.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.13,0:01:08.82,Narrator,,0,0,0,,There is also a ton of footage taken at various locations,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.82,0:01:14.85,Narrator,,0,0,0,,such as D51 running through snow-clad Hokkaido,\N or through the beautiful Chugoku region in autumn.{lib. for brevity}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.85,0:01:18.43,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It's a wonderful gift for all steam locomotive fans.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.50,0:01:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.76,0:01:45.89,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Watch this spring's big reveal:\N {\i1}Yaemon the Locomotive: D51's Great Adventure{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.89,0:01:48.59,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Be sure to check it out!
